## Note on game assets

The licence above covers **the code in this repository only** — the engine, the
tools, the documentation, and the coordinate data.

It does **not** cover any game artwork. Map images of Final Fantasy IX are the
property of Square Enix and are **not distributed here**: `.gitignore` keeps
`maps/*` out of the repository on purpose, and the app expects you to supply
your own image.

Place names and coordinates describe factual locations in a published game and
are provided for reference. Nothing in this repository is affiliated with or
endorsed by Square Enix.
